  // Eyes closing, not responding to your voice, sitting still for long stretches.
  "scanForm.concerning.alertness": "Ogen vallen dicht, reageert niet op je stem, zit lange tijd stil.",
  // Open-mouth breathing, wheeze, click, or tail bobbing at rest.
